{
  "title": "Fractal Neural Synthesis: Constant-Storage Procedural Weight Derivation via Complex Quadratic Boundary Dynamics",
  "description": "Constant-storage (24-byte) procedural hidden-layer weight derivation architecture anchored near the complex quadratic bifurcation boundary of f_c(z) = z^2 + c, with large-bailout smooth escape kernels, four geometric sampling apertures, information-theoretic capacity bounds, and reproducible 10-fold CV benchmarks.",
